## app/redis.ts  

A small utility that creates an Upstash Redis client only when the required environment variables are present. This file protects the site from crashes when Redis is unavailable (e.g., during local development).  

```typescript
import { Redis } from "@upstash/redis";

export const redis = process.env.KV_REST_API_URL && process.env.KV_REST_API_TOKEN
  ? new Redis({
      url: process.env.KV_REST_API_URL,
      token: process.env.KV_REST_API_TOKEN,
    })
  : null;
```
